# What goes where

**Types/interfaces and static content live in different places. Do not mix them.**

## Types and interfaces → `types/index.ts` only

All shared domain models, payloads, context values, and component/provider props live in **`types/index.ts`**. Import via `@/types`.

| Kind                       | Example                                                    |
| -------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| Domain models              | `Product`, `Collection`, `EnquiryFormPayload`              |
| Component / provider props | `ProductCardProps`, `ContactMapProps`, `AppProvidersProps` |
| Page params                | `CollectionDetailPageProps`                                |
| Catalog / email            | `GeneratedProductDef`, `TransactionalEmailInput`           |
| Context values             | `EnquiryContextValue`, `HeroSlideshowContextValue`         |

- **Do not** add `export type` / `export interface` to `constants/`, `components/`, `context/`, or `app/`.
- **Do not** split into `types/data.ts` / `types/components.ts` or create an `interfaces/` folder.
- New reusable type → add to `types/index.ts`.
- `lib/catalog` may re-export catalog types from `@/types` for generate-script convenience.

## Static content and config → `constants/`

| Kind | File | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Site copy, nav, labels | `constants/site.ts` | `SITE`, menus, page titles |
| Routes | `constants/routes.ts` | `ROUTES`, `collectionPath()` |
| Collection metadata | `constants/collections.ts`, `collection-keys.ts` | `COLLECTION_DEFS`, category keys, slugs |
| Layout / image sizes / motion IDs | `constants/layout.ts`, `timing.ts` | `IMAGE_SIZES`, `TIMING` |
| Editorial content arrays | `constants/hero.ts`, `press.ts`, `couture.ts`, … | slides, press quotes |

- **Hand-authored** strings, numbers, arrays, and image path helpers belong here.
- Pages/components read config from `constants/` or via `lib/data` getters — **never hardcode** copy, routes, category keys, or layout tokens in JSX/page files.

## Other locations (not `constants/` or `types/`)

| Kind                                     | Location                                        |
| ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| Auto-generated from disk                 | `generated/` — never edit                       |
| Env-based values (email, phone)          | `lib/contact.ts`                                |
| Pure logic (validation, SEO, email HTML) | `lib/validation.ts`, `lib/seo.ts`, `lib/email/` |
| Runtime content access                   | `lib/data/` getters                             |

## Quick decision

- **Shape of data** (interface/type) → `types/index.ts`
- **Actual copy, routes, flags, image lists** → `constants/`
- **Built from folders by script** → `generated/`
